          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nera ina kata ilayiok le Yakobo tomon aare. Ore ilayiok le Lea naa: Ruben, (olkikau le Yakobo), o Simion, o Lawi, o Yuda, o Isaakar o Sebulon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Raheli naa: Yosef o Benchamen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Bilhah enkaisiaayiani e Raheli naa: Dan o Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Silpa enkaisiaayiani e Lea naa Gad o Asheri. Kulo apa ilayiok le Yakobo ootoikioki ninye te Padan-aram.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.26"
            ]
          }
        }
